  "READ": "gate H certifies DATA_LATENCY_DAYS <= 21. With as_of frozen at a constant in the source, the suite reports the same latency forever: on this archive it would still say the source is fresh in 2027, 2030 and 2040. Nothing in the suite reads a real clock, and nothing compares the archive to today."
