  "GOOD_DATA_SURVIVES_A_NETWORK_ERROR": false,
  "WHAT_A_NETWORK_ERROR_DOES": "the raw files stay on disk, but collect_generic rebuilds collection_index.json from scratch every run and a failed request yields no code table, so idx['codes'] and idx['vars'] come back NULL. value_mode then returns UNSUPPORTED and current_pressure refuses the whole case. The archive is intact and unreadable. It fails CLOSED and LOUD, which is the right direction \u2014 but one failed refresh bricks a case until a full re-collection succeeds.",
